# reg-bio-4 loop-10 (F-9): megacistron + Rho termination - adversarial
# load shape. A 1500-cistron unit with scattered silences, called at the
# tail under rho.termination (catch 0.5, queue_cap 0.0 = unshielded).
# Containment: bounded runtime (O(N) scan + O(N) queue per call), no
# hang, no OOM, notes stay under the cap. Cell: rt_p14e.cell.
regulate {
    c1498 translates ptail rate 0.1
}
